    referenceEn: "If you are visiting a metropolis with a dense rail network, buying an unlimited travel pass per day can trim your transit costs sharply. Try to book in advance online so you can scan your pass straight at the airport without standing in long lines. During sightseeing days, skip boarding trains at morning rush hour when commuters pack every carriage. Rather than rushing through six landmarks non-stop, break the journey at the botanical gardens—an ideal spot for a light lunch where you can relax and upload your morning photos to the cloud before resuming your afternoon route.",
    keywords: ["unlimited travel", "book in advance", "rush hour", "break the journey", "an ideal spot for", "upload"]
